  "Loves poisoning weapons (has only accidentally poisoned himself the once). A decent enough Offensive Corporal. His motto: \"Maybe I'll get lucky someday.\"": "毒属性武器の扱いに秀逸な平隊士。攻撃型伍長としては凡庸。座右の銘は「棚からぼた餅」。",
  "Loves poisoning weapons (has only accidentally poisoned himself the once). Ill-suited for Corporal. His motto: \"Never betray your word.\"": "毒属性武器の扱いに優秀な平隊士。伍長には不向き。座右の銘は「有言実行」。",
  "Proficient trooper with good support for the Gunman style. A decent enough Offensive Corporal. His motto: \"Cherish every encounter.\"": "短銃補佐に長けた汎用的な平隊士。攻撃型伍長としては凡庸。座右の銘は「一期一会」。",
  "Capable of emitting a toxic mist at will. Unpopular as a child. Ill-suited for Corporal. His motto: \"Solidarity is the key to victory.\"": "毒霧の扱いに長けた平隊士。伍長には不向き。座右の銘は「一致団結」。",
  "Quick on his feet, he can support the Wild Dancer well. Ill-suited for Corporal. His motto: \"Tomorrow is a new day.\"": "乱舞補佐に長けた汎用的な平隊士。伍長には不向き。座右の銘は「明日は明日の風が吹く」。",
  "Capable of emitting a toxic mist at will. Unpopular as a child. Ill-suited for Corporal. His motto: \"Let the past guide the future.\"": "毒霧の扱いに長けた平隊士。伍長には不向き。座右の銘は「温故知新」。",
  "Defensive Trooper who's damn hard to stun. Makes for a trusty Defensive Corporal. His motto: \"Keep a cool head.\"": "気絶耐性の高い守備型隊士。守備型伍長として適任。座右の銘は「泰然自若」。",
  "Defensive Trooper who's damn hard to stun. Makes for a trusty Defensive Corporal. His motto: \"Imperturbable.\"": "気絶耐性の高い守備型隊士。守備型伍長として適任。座右の銘は「泰然自若」。",
  "Someone who knows how to keep enemies at a distance. Makes for a trusty Defensive Corporal in a spear squad. His motto: \"Life is the ultimate treasure.\"": "敵との距離を測る事に長けた平隊士。槍隊士を率いる守備型伍長として最適。座右の銘は「命に過ぎたる宝なし」。",
