  "A standout talent who works best alongside a Gunman. A superb candidate for Corporal with the attack power to survive any tight situation. His motto: \"Always seek to profit.\"": "短銃補佐に長けた優秀な平隊士。伍長としては窮地を生き抜く攻撃力を発揮。座右の銘は「一攫千金」。",
  "Flexible trooper with a penchant for aiding Swordsmen. A superb candidate for Corporal with the attack power to survive any tight situation. His motto: \"Even the crops learn to bow with respect.\"": "一刀補佐に長けた汎用的な平隊士。伍長としては窮地を生き抜く攻撃力を発揮。座右の銘は「実るほど首を垂れる稲穂かな」。",
  "Proficient trooper with good support for the Swordsman style. A decent enough Offensive Corporal. His motto: \"Solidarity is the key to victory.\"": "一刀補佐に長けた汎用的な平隊士。攻撃型伍長としては凡庸。座右の銘は「一致団結」。",
