  "Loves poisoning weapons (has only accidentally poisoned himself the once). Ill-suited for Corporal. His motto: \"Take everything one step at a time.\"": "毒属性武器の扱いに長けた平隊士。伍長には不向き。座右の銘は「日進月歩」。",
