  "Refuses to let the Heat drop or the drinks run dry. Makes for a trusty Offensive Corporal in a sword sqaud. His motto: \"Go balls to the wall.\"": "闘気の扱いに長けた平隊士。刀隊士を率いる攻撃型伍長として最適。座右の銘は「乾坤一擲」。",
  "Refuses to let the Heat drop or the drinks run dry. Makes for a trusty Offensive Corporal in a sword squad. His motto: \"Always look out for number one.\"": "闘気の扱いに長けた平隊士。刀隊士を率いる攻撃型伍長として最適。座右の銘は「我田引水」。",
  "Refuses to let the Heat drop or the drinks run dry. Makes for a trusty Offensive Corporal, though he's not without his own risks. His motto: \"Only the strong survive.\"": "闘気の扱いに長けた平隊士。攻撃型伍長として最適も、危険も伴う。座右の銘は「弱肉強食」。",
  "Refuses to let the Heat drop or the drinks run dry. A superb candidate for Corporal, thanks to excellent leadership skills. His motto: \"Never flinch in the face of danger.\"": "闘気の扱いに長けた平隊士。統率力の優れた伍長として適任。座右の銘は「剛毅果断」。",
  "Aguri Juntaro": "阿栗 純太郎",
  "A skilled trooper capable of raising his captain's Heat. Ill-suited for Corporal, but use him as you see fit. His motto: \"Easy come, easy go.\"": "隊長の闘気を高める点において最も優秀な平隊士。伍長には不向きも、使い方次第。座右の銘は「悪銭身につかず」。",
  "A skilled trooper capable of raising his captain's Heat. Capable as an Offensive Corporal, though not without his own risks. His motto: \"Put your heart and soul into the fight.\"": "隊長の闘気を高める点において最も優秀な平隊士。攻撃型伍長として最適も、危険も伴う。座右の銘は「一意専心」。",
  "A focused Defensive Trooper who likes solving puzzles in his spare time. Makes for a trusty Defensive Corporal. His motto: \"Always stick to your guns.\"": "集中力が高い最も優秀な守備型の平隊士。守備型伍長に最適。座右の銘は「頑固一徹」。",
  "A brilliant trooper and support for the Swordsman style. A superb candidate for Corporal with the attack power to survive any tight situation. His motto: \"Fair and fearless wins the fight.\"": "一刀補佐に長けた秀逸な平隊士。伍長としては窮地を生き抜く攻撃力を発揮。座右の銘は「質実剛健」。",
  "Likes to run around in thunderstorms with his sword out. Not dead yet. A decent enough Offensive Corporal. His motto: \"Act with heart and mind as one.\"": "雷属性武器の扱いに秀逸な平隊士。攻撃型伍長としては凡庸。座右の銘は「誠心誠意」。",
  "Likes to run around in thunderstorms with his sword out. Not dead yet. Ill-suited for Corporal. His motto: \"Do not disturb.\"": "雷属性武器の扱いに優秀な平隊士。伍長には不向き。座右の銘は「平穏無事」。",
  "Likes to run around in thunderstorms with his sword out. Not dead yet. A decent enough Offensive Corporal. His motto: \"Suffering is a hallmark of existence.\"": "雷属性武器の扱いに長けた平隊士。攻撃型伍長としては凡庸。座右の銘は「七転八倒」。",
  "Oddly resistant to electric shocks. Makes for a trusty Offensive Corporal. His motto: \"Never betray your word.\"": "電撃の扱いに長けた平隊士。攻撃型伍長として適任。座右の銘は「有言実行」。",
  "Oddly resistant to electric shocks. A superb candidate for Offensive Corporal in a spear squad. His motto: \"Just get the job done.\"": "電撃の扱いに長けた平隊士。槍隊士を率いる攻撃型伍長として最適。座右の銘は「結果がすべて」。",
